{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e14-scene-04",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "孤岛的原创挑战  (The Challenge of Greenlighting an Original Show)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Chun Yuqiao gives Bu Xiaogu ten minutes to share her honest assessment of his original reality-show proposal, and she dives straight into both its creative appeal and its commercial hurdles. Listen to the Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "十分钟，你答我几个问题，孤岛策划案你看了吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我可以参与讨论孤岛的策划吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "说说想法。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我觉得孤岛的创意和设计特别有代入感。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我们九零后刚刚步入职场，每天面临着很多未知的挑战。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我们每个人每天都努力地生活在城市的精神孤岛上。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我觉得这是一个真正的原创节目。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "除了创意，你还想到了什么？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我在想这个节目立项的难度。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "从商业角度讲，没有平台愿意冒险去投资本土原创节目。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这样长期下来，就会形成一个恶性循环。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "所以你担心公司不会支持？那如果支持，你刚刚的长篇大论不就白说了吗？",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "十分钟，你答我几个问题，孤岛策划案你看了吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Ten minutes to answer a few questions—have you read the Lonely Island proposal?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我可以参与讨论孤岛的策划吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'May I take part in discussing the Lonely Island plan?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "说说想法。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Tell me your thoughts.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我觉得孤岛的创意和设计特别有代入感。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I think the concept and format of Lonely Island feel remarkably relatable.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我们九零后刚刚步入职场，每天面临着很多未知的挑战。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Our post-nineties generation just entered the workplace and faces unknown challenges daily.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我们每个人每天都努力地生活在城市的精神孤岛上。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Every one of us works hard each day living on an emotional island in the city.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我觉得这是一个真正的原创节目。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I think this is a genuinely original programme.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "除了创意，你还想到了什么？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Beyond the creative concept, what else occurred to you?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我在想这个节目立项的难度。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I was thinking about how hard it will be to get this show greenlit.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "从商业角度讲，没有平台愿意冒险去投资本土原创节目。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Commercially speaking, no platform wants to risk investing in domestic original shows.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这样长期下来，就会形成一个恶性循环。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Over the long run, that creates a vicious cycle.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "所以你担心公司不会支持？那如果支持，你刚刚的长篇大论不就白说了吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'So you worry the company will not back it? If they do, was your big speech all in vain?'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "十分钟，你答我几个问题，孤岛策划案你看了吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
