    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "从商业角度讲，没有平台愿意冒险去投资本土原创节目。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这样长期下来，就会形成一个恶性循环。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "所以你担心公司不会支持？那如果支持，你刚刚的长篇大论不就白说了吗？",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Impressed by Bu Xiaogu's big-picture industry analysis, Chun Yuqiao responds with an unexpected research assignment. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "下次见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
